Cell["\<\
The assertion registry contains Distinct, Member and EqualDistance only. \
Finite exploration retains merged states and all incoming events, with \
explicit incomplete frontiers. Older scene descriptors lacking \
ScheduleValidity must be rebuilt from their original syntax before \
exploration. A saved viewer reads the saved record without sampling; a \
literal binding filter changes the view, not the saved fixed inputs.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"f97dd953-1119-42d7-96ef-3a9bf63d7d61"],

Cell["\<\
The 39 official guide entries are a scope inventory, not a fully implemented \
catalog. Triangle centers and constructions, angle choices, centroids, corner \
boundaries and fillings, circles through points, signed distance, conjectures \
and the scene entity library remain deferred. Existing graph distance, \
length, boundary and measure operations retain their own declared meanings.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"d95318ff-005e-49f3-b54f-b393208f0bd4"],

